        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Chinese Nursery Rhymes</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            margin: 0;\n            font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        .document {\n            width: 750px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 6px solid #67c2f1;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 60px 40px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n        .placeholder {\n            position: absolute;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            border: 1px dashed #999;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            color: #666;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 2px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        .icon-sun {\n            top: 10px;\n            left: 10px;\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n        }\n        .icon-glass {\n            bottom: 10px;\n            right: 10px;\n            width: 45px;\n            height: 60px;\n        }\n        .grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            row-gap: 50px;\n            column-gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .col {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        .content-wrapper {\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n        .title {\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #5575d9;\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .text {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            color: #333333;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"document\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-sun\">\n            <span>[Icon: Sun]</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <!-- Top Left -->\n            <div class=\"col\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"title\">《猫吃桃》</div>\n                    <div class=\"text\">\n                        河边有座窑，<br>\n                        窑上有个槽，<br>\n                        槽里放件袍，<br>\n                        袍包个桃。<br>\n                        对岸有只猫，<br>\n                        想吃窑上槽里袍包桃，<br>\n                        可惜岸上没有桥。<br>\n                        过不了河，<br>\n                        上不了窑，<br>\n                        够不着槽，<br>\n                        咬不住袍，<br>\n                        吃不了桃。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Top Right -->\n            <div class=\"col\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"title\">《数青蛙》</div>\n                    <div class=\"text\">\n                        一只青蛙一张嘴，<br>\n                        两只眼睛四条腿，<br>\n                        扑通一声跳下水。<br>\n                        两只青蛙两张嘴，<br>\n                        四只眼睛八条腿，<br>\n                        扑通扑通两声跳下水。<br>\n                        三只青蛙三张嘴，<br>\n                        六只眼睛十二条腿，<br>\n                        扑通扑通扑通三声跳下水。<br>\n                        四只青蛙四张嘴，<br>\n                        八只眼睛十六条腿，<br>\n                        扑通扑通扑通扑通四声跳下水。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Bottom Left -->\n            <div class=\"col\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"title\">《姥姥有个宝宝》</div>\n                    <div class=\"text\">\n                        姥姥有个宝宝，<br>\n                        宝宝有位姥姥，<br>\n                        姥姥疼爱宝宝，<br>\n                        宝宝喜爱姥姥。<br>\n                        姥姥天天抱宝宝，<br>\n                        宝宝天天亲姥姥，<br>\n                        姥姥老，走不好，<br>\n                        抱着宝宝摔一跤，<br>\n                        跌了姥姥，摔了宝宝，<br>\n                        宝宝连忙扶姥姥，<br>\n                        姥姥赶快抱宝宝。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Bottom Right -->\n            <div class=\"col\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"title\">《南南有个篮》</div>\n                    <div class=\"text\">\n                        南南有个篮篮，<br>\n                        篮篮装着盘盘，<br>\n                        盘盘放着碗碗，<br>\n                        碗碗盛着饭饭。<br>\n                        南南翻了篮篮，<br>\n                        篮篮扣了盘盘，<br>\n                        盘盘打了碗碗，<br>\n                        碗碗撒了饭饭。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-glass\">\n            <span>[Icon: Glass with straw]</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
